  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Add beef and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Remove beef from pot, set aside.",
    "Add onions to pot and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add carrots and potatoes to pot, cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add flour to pot, stir to combine.",
    "Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Gradually add beef broth, red wine, and apple cider vinegar.",
    "Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low.",
    "Return beef to pot.",
    "Add red chilli powder, dashi extract, black pepper, and salt.",
    "Cover and simmer for 2 hours, or until beef is tender.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley."
